# 1️⃣4️⃣ Floor vs Ceil

| Concept | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| Floor | Largest value ≤ x |
| Ceil | Smallest value ≥ x |

Example:

```text
Values = 2 4 6 8 10

x = 7
```

```text
Floor = 6

Ceil = 8
```

