# 1️⃣5️⃣ Important BST Patterns

## Pattern 1: Searching

```text
target < root
→ LEFT

target > root
→ RIGHT
```

---

## Pattern 2: LCA

```text
Both smaller
→ LEFT

Both greater
→ RIGHT

Otherwise
→ Current Node
```

---

## Pattern 3: Minimum

```text
Keep moving LEFT
```

---

## Pattern 4: Maximum

```text
Keep moving RIGHT
```

---

## Pattern 5: Successor

```text
Find smallest value > target
```

---

## Pattern 6: Predecessor

```text
Find largest value < target
```

---

## Pattern 7: Floor

```text
Largest value <= x
```

---

## Pattern 8: Ceil

```text
Smallest value >= x
```

